<title>USA: Hello Direct financial chief resigns.</title>
<headline>Hello Direct financial chief resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hello Direct Inc said Thursday Norman Bunas resigned as vice president of operations and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Bunas left &quot;to pursue other interests.&quot;</p>
<p>It said Bunas will remain with the company through the end of October, and that the search for a successor was under way.</p>
</text>
